WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:21.100
The long-forgotten secret of New Belgrade is that the buildings in blocks 61-64 were originally meant to be complete triangles of 19 floors, but during construction they were cut, and the famous stepped towers of today were built instead.

2
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:32.900
Although the original idea of triangular buildings was not realised, that old experiment left a trace in the form of unique brutalist architecture that still fascinates visitors today.
